\n## Steps:\\\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\\\n2. Login with credentials: Username: theagentcompany, Password: theagentcompany\\\\n3. Close any modal dialogs that appear on first login\\\\n4. Navigate through folders by:\\\\n   - Clicking on folder names in the main file list\\\\n   - Using breadcrumb navigation at the top\\\\n   - Direct URL navigation using pattern: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/path/to/folder\\\\n5. Search for files using the search box in the top navigation bar\\\\n\\\\n## Navigation Patterns:\\\\n- Root directory: /index.php/apps/files?dir=/\\\\n- Documents folder: /index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents\\\\n- Financials folder: /index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Financials\\\\n- Administrative Specialist: /index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Administrative%20Specialist\\\\n\\\\n## File Access:\\\\n- Click on file names to view/download\\\\n- PDF files can be downloaded via direct URL: /remote.php/webdav/path/to/file.pdf\\\\n- Use curl with authentication: curl -u \\\\\"username:password\\\\\" \\\\\"http://url/remote.php/webdav/path/to/file\\\\\" -o output_file\\\\n\\\\n## Notes:\\\\n- Some folders may have spaces in names (URL encoded as %20)\\\\n- File previews available for some file types\\\\n- Sidebar shows file details when a file is selected\\\\n\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'FileNavigation'}), MCPAction(name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'FileUploadDownload'}, thought='', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"\\\\n# OwnCloud - File Upload and Download\\\\n\\\\n## Steps:\\\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\\\n2. Use direct URL navigation for specific folders:\\\\n   - Documents: /index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents\\\\n   - Human Resources Team: /index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team\\\\n3. To download files:\\\\n   - Use curl with authentication: curl -u \\\\\"username:password\\\\\" \\\\\"http://url/remote.php/webdav/path/to/file\\\\\" -o output_file\\\\n   - Example: curl -u \\\\\"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\\\\\" \\\\\"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Personnell_File.odt\\\\\" -o Personnell_File.odt\\\\n4. To upload files:\\\\n   - Use curl with -T flag: curl -u \\\\\"username:password\\\\\" -T \\\\\"local_file\\\\\" \\\\\"http://url/remote.php/webdav/path/to/destination_file\\\\\"\\\\n   - Example: curl -u \\\\\"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\\\\\" -T \\\\\"Career_Ladder.odt\\\\\" \\\\\"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Career_Ladder.odt\\\\\"\\\\n5. Verify file operations by refreshing the browser or checking file timestamps\\\\n\\\\n## Notes:\\\\n- URL encode spaces in folder names as %20\\\\n- Files are immediately visible in the web interface after upload\\\\n- The browser interface may have modal dialogs that need to be closed or bypassed\\\\n- For ODT files, extract content using Python\\'s zipfile and xml.etree.ElementTree modules\\\\n\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'FileUploadDownload'}), MCPAction(name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat', 'operation': 'Authentication'}, thought='', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Service URL: http://the-agent-company.com:3000\\\\nEmail: theagentcompany\\\\nPassword: theagentcompany\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType