 assessment\\n  - Oversees all technical projects\\n\\nENGINEERING DEPARTMENT\\n{\\'-\\' * 20}\\nEngineering Leadership:\\n\u2022 Database Team Project Manager: Li Ming\\n  - Managing database projects, resource coordination, ensuring timely delivery\\n\\nSenior Technical Roles:\\n\u2022 Senior Software Engineer (Streaming Database): Zhang Wei\\n  - Developing and optimizing core streaming database functionalities\\n\u2022 Senior Software Engineer (AI Team): Mike Chen  \\n  - Developing and optimizing LLM inference engines\\n\u2022 AI Researcher: Wang Fang\\n  - Designing and implementing machine learning models, optimizing model performance\\n\\nMid-Level Engineers:\\n\u2022 Quality Assurance Engineer: Liu Qiang\\n  - Developing test strategies, executing tests, ensuring product quality\\n\u2022 Software Engineer (Low-Code Platform): Alex Turner\\n\u2022 Software Engineer (API Team): Emma Lewis\\n\u2022 Frontend Software Engineer: Jessica Chen\\n  - Developing user interfaces, implementing responsive designs\\n\\nEntry-Level & Specialized Roles:\\n\u2022 Software Engineer (Web Crawler): Emily Zhou\\n  - Designing and implementing web crawler functionalities\\n\u2022 Documentation Engineer: Priya Sharma\\n  - Writing technical documentation, maintaining wiki\\n\\nPRODUCT & DESIGN\\n{\\'-\\' * 20}\\n\u2022 Product Manager (Search Engine): Huang Jie\\n  - Defining product requirements, planning product roadmap\\n\u2022 UX Designer: Sophia Rodriguez\\n  - Designing user interfaces, improving user experience\\n\\nBUSINESS OPERATIONS\\n{\\'-\\' * 20}\\n\u2022 Sales Director: Mark Johnson\\n  - Developing sales strategies, managing sales team\\n\u2022 Marketing Manager: Jessica Lee\\n  - Developing marketing strategies, managing brand image\\n\u2022 Human Resources Manager: Chen Xinyi\\n  - Recruitment, employee training, compensation management\\n\u2022 Finance Director: David Wong\\n  - Financial planning, budget management, financial reporting\\n\\nCAREER GROWTH PATHS\